    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d671">

                <pb facs="1335" n="1313" sameAs="frus:frus1946v01/pg1313"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">560.AL/4–1846: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">u.s. urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1946-04-18T19:00:00-05:00">April 18, 1946—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3329. For Hawkins from Wilcox. Decision has been made to postpone negotiating
                    meeting until next year. No announcement being made by Department. Will send you
                    recommended program as soon as possible. [Wilcox.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
